<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston cut its rating for Brazilian telephone holding Telebras SA Monday to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) in Telebras were off 1-15/16 to 152-7/16 in early trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
